<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark Dec 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark Dec 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers BHF Bank, Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan</p>
<p>Grenfell and Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK HANNOVER</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    20.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE   *04.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	FLAT</p>
<p> NOTES     **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>	    *PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> LISTING    HANNOVER</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.375 PERCENT DEC 2002 TREUHAND  NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 724</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
